{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fqfOmuDHJF1793175729.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區主要股市造好。</p><p></p><p>日本股市曾經急升逾一千點，但收市時64,000點得而復失。晶片生產商鎧俠揚升逾一成，愛德萬和東京威力科創，升百分之3至4。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市升穿6,000點大關，收市升約百分之6.6，見近三個月以來最大單日升幅。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市兩連升，並以接近全日高位收市。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市則先升後輕微回軟。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:38.112406+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:10.778463+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:47.755596+00:00","content_hash":"42d05bea0f3f2cd0a5070df46d130f40a2ffa7ebef0234bbaa2d489d8dad29d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:38.112406+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}